         { id: "fileload-champion-glue", claim: "a file-load resets the VISIBLE champion too, not just the streaming evaluator — the loaded quilt's best net becomes champNet (falling back to the merged pop[0] for best-less quilts) and the stale pre-load game is cleared, mirroring the loadLevel precedent; before R62 the demo kept playing the pre-load champion under the loaded banner (measured L2 4.943 to the loaded pop, the R56-P2 magnitude one lane over) (Round 62, R61 spec item 'File-load champion reset')", proofTest: "tests/r62-fileload-champion-glue.test.js" },
